{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-i", "title": "梁惠王上", "description": "孟子見梁惠王。王曰：「叟不遠千里而來，亦將有以利吾國乎？」\n孟子對曰：「王何必曰利？亦有仁義而已矣。王曰『何以利吾國』？大夫曰『何以利吾家』？士庶人曰『何以利吾身』？上下交征利而國危矣。萬乘之國弒其君者，必千乘之家；千乘之國弒其君者，必百乘之家。萬取千焉，千取百焉，不為不多矣。苟為後義而先利，不奪不饜。未有仁而遺其親者", "occurrences": 5, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "乘", "id": "乘"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "保", "id": "保"}, {"form": "利", "id": "利"}, {"form": "加", "id": "加"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "家", "id": "家"}, {"form": "寡人", "id": "寡人"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "恩", "id": "恩"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "易", "id": "易"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "牛", "id": "牛"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "百姓", "id": "百姓"}, {"form": "羊", "id": "羊"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "見", "id": "見"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.4011973816621555, "source": "下", "target": "牛"}, {"weight": 1.8971199848858813, "source": "牛", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.995732273553991, "source": "牛", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "牛", "target": "愛"}, {"weight": 2.70805020110221, "source": "牛", "target": "羊"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "牛", "target": "見"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "人", "target": "加"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "人", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "人", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 0.25131442828090617, "source": "人", "target": "用"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "家", "target": "利"}, {"weight": 3.58351893845611, "source": "家", "target": "乘"}, {"weight": 2.8903717578961645, "source": "家", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.0794415416798357, "source": "家", "target": "國"}, {"weight